## Kotlin / JVM conventions

- **Build**: Gradle with the Kotlin DSL (`./gradlew build`, `./gradlew test`). Prefer the wrapper
  over a system Gradle.
- **Coroutines**: never block a thread with `runBlocking` outside `main` or tests; pass a
  `CoroutineScope` in and cancel it on shutdown.
- **Nullability**: model absence with `null` only when it is legal domain state; otherwise use a
  sealed result type.
- **Style**: `val` over `var`, expression bodies for one-liners, no wildcard imports, no
  `!!` without an adjacent invariant comment.
- **Versions** live in `gradle/libs.versions.toml`; do not pin dependency versions inside module
  build files.
